{"post": true, "caption": "Nassim Taleb made this point in his book Fooled by Randomness: the more often you look, the more noise you see.\nIn his example, an investment that returns 15% a year with 10% swings shows a gain about 93% of the time if you check yearly, but only about 54% if you check daily.\nSame investment. Different stress. Set your stop, set an alert, then let the plan do the watching.\nTag the friend who refreshes the chart every 5 minutes.\n\nEducation only. Not financial advice.\n\n#CandleAndCode #ThisIsSoMe #TradingPsychology #TradingForBeginners #Patience", "tag": "THIS IS SO ME", "footer": "Education only. Not financial advice.", "bpm": 92, "scenes": [{"type": "hook", "dur": 2.4, "size": 110, "lines": [{"t": "5-YEAR PLAN.", "c": "green"}, {"t": "5-MIN CHECKS.", "c": "red"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "size": 92, "lines": [{"t": "Open the app.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "Refresh. Again.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "Sound familiar?", "c": "muted"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "size": 88, "lines": [{"t": "Here's why it", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "feels so bad.", "c": "red"}, {"t": "Watch this.", "c": "muted"}]}, {"type": "bars", "dur": 6.0, "title": "Chance you see a gain", "subtitle": "example: +15% a year, 10% swings", "rows": [{"l": "Check yearly", "v": 93, "vl": "93%", "lc": "fg", "bc": "green"}, {"l": "Check monthly", "v": 67, "vl": "67%", "lc": "fg", "bc": "green"}, {"l": "Check daily", "v": 54, "vl": "54%", "lc": "fg", "bc": "red"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "size": 88, "lines": [{"t": "Every 5 minutes?", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "Basically a coin flip.", "c": "red"}, {"t": "Same investment.", "c": "muted"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.2, "size": 92, "lines": [{"t": "More checking", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "isn't more control.", "c": "red"}, {"t": "It's more stress.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "size": 92, "lines": [{"t": "Set the alert.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "Close the app.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "Let the plan watch.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "end", "dur": 2.2, "line": "Trade with a system, not a feeling."}]}